Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Checkpoint: Hardened the cloud sync migration for
 projects that already have the earlier sync table. It now revokes all default
 privileges, including TRUNCATE (which bypasses row-level security), and
 removes the old direct-write policies. Added an upgrade test that applies the
 migration over the earlier table and confirms existing backups are kept.

Co-authored-by: factory-droid[bot] <138933559+factory-droid[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
